            "width": 37.98882681564246,
            "height": 8.830022075055187,
            "action": {
              "library": "H5P.AdvancedText 1.1",
              "params": {
                "text": "<p><span style=\"font-size:1.5em;\"><strong>INFORMATION TEXT (Part 2)</strong></span></p>\n"
              },
              "metadata": {
                "contentType": "Text",
                "license": "U",
                "title": "Unbenannt: Text",
                "defaultLanguage": "en"
              },
              "subContentId": "55aaf4d3-f7e3-4a3e-9196-01a6f7474f94"
            },
            "alwaysDisplayComments": false,
            "backgroundOpacity": 0,
            "displayAsButton": false,
            "buttonSize": "big",
            "goToSlideType": "specified",
            "invisible": false,
            "solution": ""
          },
          {
            "x": 2.23463687150838,
            "y": 13.245033112582782,
            "width": 92.73743016759778,
            "height": 86.09271523178808,
            "action": {
              "library": "H5P.AdvancedText 1.1",
              "params": {
                "text": "<p><strong>Contribution to Heart Surgery</strong><br>\nThe techniques developed by Forssmann allowed for detailed heart examinations and opened the door for various types of heart surgeries. These procedures have saved countless lives and are considered routine today.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Nobel Prize in Medicine</strong><br>\nIn 1956, Werner Forssmann was awarded the Nobel Prize in Medicine, sharing the honor with André Cournand and Dickinson W. Richards. They were recognized for their work in discovering important diagnostic techniques for heart diseases.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Impact on Modern Medicine</strong><br>\nForssmann's work on cardiac catheterization has had a long-lasting impact on medicine, providing a foundation for complex procedures such as angioplasty and pacemaker insertions, improving patient outcomes globally.</p>\n"
              },
              "metadata": {
                "contentType": "Text",
                "license": "U",
                "title": "Unbenannt: Text",
                "defaultLanguage": "en"
              },
              "subContentId": "3b13867b-feab-4e2e-bfa2-fcc82e4dbff1"
            },
            "alwaysDisplayComments": false,
            "backgroundOpacity": 0,
            "displayAsButton": false,
