            "width": 92.73743016759778,
            "height": 86.09271523178808,
            "action": {
              "library": "H5P.AdvancedText 1.1",
              "params": {
                "text": "<p><strong>Challenges and Controversy</strong><br>\nDespite the revolutionary nature of his work, Forssmann faced challenges in gaining recognition and spent much of his career outside of the mainstream medical community. His determination amidst controversy is a testament to his dedication to medicine.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Later Life and Other Interests</strong><br>\nAfter his Nobel win, Forssmann continued his medical practice and took on other interests, including hunting and politics. He served as a doctor in a small town in Germany for many years, practicing medicine until his retirement.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Legacy of Werner Forssmann</strong><br>\nWerner Forssmann passed away in 1979, but the technique he pioneered is still used widely in medicine. His courage and innovation are celebrated, and his legacy lives on in the countless medical professionals who practice the techniques he developed.</p>\n"
              },
              "metadata": {
                "contentType": "Text",
                "license": "U",
                "title": "Unbenannt: Text",
